d '{$a}'";s:22:"error:recordnotupdated";s:25:"Record not updated '{$a}'";s:25:"error:recursivedefinition";s:32:"Recursive basedon VPL definition";s:18:"error:uninstalling";s:58:"Error uninstalling VPL. All data may have not been deleted";s:17:"error:zipnotfound";s:18:"ZIP file not found";s:8:"evaluate";s:8:"Evaluate";s:13:"evaluate_help";s:104:"Allows students to evaluate their submission automatically. Teachers can always evaluate any submission.";s:20:"evaluateonsubmission";s:30:"Evaluate upon files submission";s:25:"evaluateonsubmission_help";s:138:"If set to Yes, performs an evaluation upon files submission via the "Submission" tab. This does not affect submissions via the "Edit" tab.";s:10:"evaluating";s:10:"Evaluating";s:10:"evaluation";s:10:"Evaluation";s:15:"evaluation_mode";s:15:"Evaluation mode";s:23:"evaluation_mode:default";s:35:"Evaluate in terminal mode (default)";s:25:"evaluation_mode:textingui";s:20:"Evaluate in GUI mode";s:20:"evaluation_mode_help";s:217:"Evaluation mode for this activity.<br>
<b>Default</b>: Evaluate in terminal mode (original behaviour).<br>
<b>Text in GUI</b>: Evaluate program in GUI mode.<br>
<b>Note</b>: Custom scripts can ignore this setting.<br>";s:9:"evaluator";s:9:"Evaluator";s:14:"evaluator_help";s:257:"Select here the evaluator framework to use in this activity.<br>Use default for original BIOTES evaluator.<br>Use GIOTES for the new evaluator framework compatible with the default.<br>Custom script indicates that the default script has been customized.<br>";s:8:"examples";s:8:"Examples";s:9:"execution";s:9:"Execution";s:27:"execution_connection_failed";s:37:"Connection to execution server failed";s:32:"execution_connection_failed_help";s:631:"<p><strong>Warning:</strong> Your browser could not connect directly to the execution server.</p>
<p>Click the server link(s) below to diagnose the problem:</p>
<ul>
<li>If you see a certificate warning, the execution server certificate is not trusted by your browser. At your own risk, you can accept the certificate and retry your action.</li>
<li>If the page does not load, the connection from your browser to the execution server may be blocked by a firewall or network configuration.</li>
</ul>
<p>Contact your server or network administrator to ensure that the execution server is reachable and has a trusted certificate.</p>";s:14:"executionfiles";s:15:"Execution files";s:19:"executionfiles_help";s:343:"<p>Here you set the files that are needed to prepare the execution,
debug or assessment of a submission. This includes scripting files, program test files and data files.</p>
<p>If you don't set script files for run or debug submissions, the system
will resolve the language you use (based on file name extensions) and use a
predefined script.";s:16:"executionoptions";s:17:"Execution options";s:21:"executionoptions_help";s:920:"<p>Various execution options are set in this page</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Based on</b>: sets other VPL instance from which some features are imported:
<ul><li>Execution files (concatenating the predefined scripting files)</li>
<li>Limits for the execution resources.</li>
<li>Variations, that are concatenating to generate multivariations.</li>
<li>Maximum length for each file to be uploaded with the submission</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><b>Run</b>, <b>Debug</b> and <b>Evaluate</b>: must be set to 'Yes' if the corresponding action can be executed when editing the submission. This affects to the students only, users with  capability of grading can always execute these actions.</li>
<li><b>Evaluate upon files submission</b>: the submission is evaluated automatically when it is uploaded.</li>
<li><b>Automatic grading</b>: if the evaluation result includes grading codes, they are used to set the grade automatically.</li>
</ul>";s:4:"file";s:4:"File";s:14:"fileNotChanged";s:20:"File has not changed";s:9:"file_name";s:9:"File name";s:9:"fileadded";s:30:"The '{$a}' file has been added";s:11:"filedeleted";s:32:"The '{$a}' file has been deleted";s:8:"filelist";s:9:"File list";s:12:"filenotadded";s:23:"File has not been added";s:14:"filenotdeleted";s:36:"The '{$a}' file has NOT been deleted";s:14:"filenotrenamed";s:36:"The '{$a}' file has NOT been renamed";s:11:"filerenamed";s:52:"The '{$a->from}' file has been renamed to '{$a->to}'";s:20:"filesChangedNotSaved";s:47:"Files have changed but they have not been saved";s:15:"filesNotChanged";s:22:"Files have not changed";s:11:"filestoscan";s:13:"Files to scan";s:11:"fileupdated";s:32:"The '{$a}' file has been updated";s:14:"finalreduction";s:15:"Final reduction";s:19:"finalreduction_help";s:262:"<b>FR [NE/FE R]</b><br>
