<b>NE</b> Automatic evaluations requested by the student.<br>
<b>FE</b> Free evaluations allowed.<br>
<b>R</b> Grade reduction by evaluation. If it is a percent, it is applied over previous result.<br>";s:4:"find";s:4:"Find";s:12:"find_replace";s:12:"Find/Replace";s:8:"fontsize";s:9:"Font size";s:15:"freeevaluations";s:16:"Free evaluations";s:20:"freeevaluations_help";s:62:"Number of automatic evaluations that do not reduce final score";s:11:"fromthisvpl";s:20:"From this VPL ({$a})";s:7:"fromvpl";s:13:"From VPL {$a}";s:15:"fulldescription";s:16:"Full description";s:20:"fulldescription_help";s:261:"<p>You must write here a full description for the activity.</p>
