7:"Variation options";s:10:"variations";s:10:"Variations";s:15:"variations_help";s:565:"<p>A set of variations can be defined for an activity. These variations are randomly assigned to the students.</p>
<p>Here you can indicate if this activity has variations, put a title for the set of variations, and to add the desired variations.</p>
<p>Each variation has an identification code and a description. The identification code is used by the <b>vpl_environment.sh</b> file to pass
the variation assigned to each student to the script files. The description, formatted in HTML, is shown to the students that have assigned
the corresponding variation.</p>";s:17:"variations_unused";s:46:"This activity has variations, but are disabled";s:14:"variationtitle";s:15:"Variation title";s:17:"varidentification";s:14:"Identification";s:12:"visiblegrade";s:7:"Visible";s:3:"vpl";s:23:"Virtual Programming Lab";s:15:"vpl:addinstance";s:21:"Add new vpl instances";s:20:"vpl:editothersgrades";s:31:"Edit grades done by other users";s:9:"vpl:grade";s:20:"Grade VPL assignment";s:10:"vpl:manage";s:21:"Manage VPL assignment";s:12:"vpl:setjails";s:50:"Set execution servers for particular VPL instances";s:14:"vpl:similarity";s:32:"Search VPL assignment similarity";s:10:"vpl:submit";s:21:"Submit VPL assignment";s:8:"vpl:view";s:36:"View full VPL assignment description";s:12:"vpl_debug.sh";s:34:"This script prepares the debugging";s:18:"vpl_evaluate.cases";s:25:"Test cases for evaluation";s:15:"vpl_evaluate.sh";s:35:"This script prepares the evaluation";s:10:"vpl_run.sh";s:34:"This script prepares the execution";s:10:"webservice";s:10:"Webservice";s:15:"webservice_help";s:76:"This webservice can be used to retrieve and submit files for VPL activities.";s:16:"webserviceglobal";s:21:"Global VPL webservice";s:21:"webserviceglobal_help";s:122:"The following personal token is permanent and can be used for any VPL across the platform, using the given webservice URL.";s:15:"webservicelocal";s:20:"Local VPL webservice";s:20:"webservicelocal_help";s:152:"The following personal token can only be used for this VPL. It is temporary, and will most likely be reset in the next 24 hours or upon session closing.";s:23:"webserviceloginasnotice";s:97:"You are logged in as another user. Their personal token with global access will not be displayed.";s:15:"webservicetoken";s:15:"Personal token:";s:13:"webserviceurl";s:15:"Webservice URL:";s:17:"webserviceurlfull";s:9:"Full URL:";s:22:"webserviceurlpwdnotice";s:144:"This VPL is protected by a password that is not given for security reasons. It should be added to the given URL as a 